WEBVTT

00:07:56.514 --> 00:08:01.227
(Applause)

00:08:01.519 --> 00:08:02.520
For this reason,

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:04.188
optimism can be an illusion

00:08:04.188 --> 00:08:06.440
to the experience
of Black people in America.

00:08:07.358 --> 00:08:08.359
In this TED Talk,

00:08:08.359 --> 00:08:10.152
I’m not trying to gatekeep,

00:08:10.152 --> 00:08:13.531
but I’m definitely trying to let you know
who built the damn gate.

00:08:13.531 --> 00:08:14.532
(Laughs)

00:08:14.532 --> 00:08:19.662
(Applause and cheers)

00:08:20.162 --> 00:08:23.415
The fact that I can make a stake
in the reclamation of Black things

00:08:23.415 --> 00:08:24.416
and Black culture

00:08:24.416 --> 00:08:25.876
makes me very optimistic.

00:08:26.585 --> 00:08:30.839
To be on stage at the premiere conference
for the experts in their field,